{"content_hash": "cb45c927528fd130", "version_id": 1003, "article_id": 101, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra, but testers are not impressed", "title_zh": "OpenAI上线GPT-6.2 Astra，但测试者并不买账", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8209040.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705769942705-45266e50628b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Z3B0JTIwYXN0cmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDk3MDg2MHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Michał Robak on Unsplash", "author": "Michał Robak", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@misha_blivi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-small-black-car-parked-in-a-grassy-area-hCHCJv6TO7E?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(90, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(128, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "dbba3384ace2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-18", "word_count": 167, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "OpenAI has released its new GPT-6.2 Astra model, which is cheaper and better at making slides and reports. However, some early testers say it often fails to follow instructions and cannot finish complex tasks.", "lead_zh": "OpenAI发布了新一代GPT-6.2 Astra模型，价格更低，做幻灯片和报告也更擅长。不过，一些提前测试的人说，它常常不按指令办事，复杂任务也做不完。", "preview": "The update came 75 days after the last Astra model, and OpenAI also launched a smaller model called 6.2 Sol. The company says the new tools ", "preview_zh": "这次更新距离上一代Astra发布过去了75天，OpenAI同时还推出了一个更小的模型6.2 Sol。公司表示，新工具在撰写专业文档、制作3D模型和工程工作方面都强了不少。Astra的API价格也降了20%。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 987, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 63.125, "size_bytes": 379728, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 64.65, "size_bytes": 388800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 69.525, "size_bytes": 418176, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 60.85, "size_bytes": 366048, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 63.425, "size_bytes": 381456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@da71318d/content/data/versions/1003.json", "paragraphs": ["The update came 75 days after the last Astra model, and OpenAI also launched a smaller model called 6.2 Sol. The company says the new tools are much better at writing professional documents, building 3D models and doing engineering work. Astra's API price also fell by 20 percent.", "OpenAI showed Astra making a sales report and a car engine model, and it even helped design a paper lamp. However, outside testers were less happy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped halfway through tasks to ask useless questions, and once made a project slower by 56 percent.", "Matt Shumer, who once praised Astra, now says the models are almost unusable because they ignore instructions. OpenAI admitted one safety test got worse, although it says it is still investigating why this happened.", "Astra and Sol are now open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users, and developers can call them through the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这次更新距离上一代Astra发布过去了75天，OpenAI同时还推出了一个更小的模型6.2 Sol。公司表示，新工具在撰写专业文档、制作3D模型和工程工作方面都强了不少。Astra的API价格也降了20%。", "OpenAI展示了Astra制作销售报告和汽车发动机模型，它甚至还帮忙设计了一盏纸灯。不过，外部测试者并不太满意。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra经常在任务做到一半时停下来问些没用的问题，有一次还让项目慢了56%。", "曾夸过Astra的Matt Shumer现在说，这些模型几乎没法用，因为它们不理会指令。OpenAI承认有一项安全测试结果变差了，但表示仍在调查原因。", "Astra和Sol现已向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放，开发者也可以通过API调用。Astra每百万输入Token收费8美元，每百万输出Token收费40美元。"], "body": "The update came 75 days after the last Astra model, and OpenAI also launched a smaller model called 6.2 Sol. The company says the new tools are much better at writing professional documents, building 3D models and doing engineering work. Astra's API price also fell by 20 percent.\n\nOpenAI showed Astra making a sales report and a car engine model, and it even helped design a paper lamp. However, outside testers were less happy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped halfway through tasks to ask useless questions, and once made a project slower by 56 percent.\n\nMatt Shumer, who once praised Astra, now says the models are almost unusable because they ignore instructions. OpenAI admitted one safety test got worse, although it says it is still investigating why this happened.\n\nAstra and Sol are now open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users, and developers can call them through the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens.", "body_zh": "这次更新距离上一代Astra发布过去了75天，OpenAI同时还推出了一个更小的模型6.2 Sol。公司表示，新工具在撰写专业文档、制作3D模型和工程工作方面都强了不少。Astra的API价格也降了20%。\n\nOpenAI展示了Astra制作销售报告和汽车发动机模型，它甚至还帮忙设计了一盏纸灯。不过，外部测试者并不太满意。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra经常在任务做到一半时停下来问些没用的问题，有一次还让项目慢了56%。\n\n曾夸过Astra的Matt Shumer现在说，这些模型几乎没法用，因为它们不理会指令。OpenAI承认有一项安全测试结果变差了，但表示仍在调查原因。\n\nAstra和Sol现已向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放，开发者也可以通过API调用。Astra每百万输入Token收费8美元，每百万输出Token收费40美元。", "text": "The update came 75 days after the last Astra model, and OpenAI also launched a smaller model called 6.2 Sol. The company says the new tools are much better at writing professional documents, building 3D models and doing engineering work. Astra's API price also fell by 20 percent. OpenAI showed Astra making a sales report and a car engine model, and it even helped design a paper lamp. However, outside testers were less happy. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped halfway through tasks to ask useless questions, and once made a project slower by 56 percent. Matt Shumer, who once praised Astra, now says the models are almost unusable because they ignore instructions. OpenAI admitted one safety test got worse, although it says it is still investigating why this happened. Astra and Sol are now open to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users, and developers can call them through the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用于产品、模型上线", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tester", "pos": "noun", "zh": "测试者", "note": "指提前试用产品的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "instruction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "指令；指示", "note": "follow instructions 表示按指令办事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "complex", "pos": "adj", "zh": "复杂的", "note": "常与 task、problem 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "engineer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "工程师", "note": "engineering 是工程", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "admit", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承认", "note": "后接事实或错误", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "调查", "note": "比 look into 更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unusable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "无法使用的", "note": "un- 表示否定", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "per", "pos": "prep", "zh": "每", "note": "per million 每百万", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "praise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "称赞", "note": "过去式 praised", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T03:00:56.946570", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "update", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.75, "sm": 375, "em": 750, "cs": 4, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "came", "s": 0.75, "e": 0.988, "sm": 750, "em": 987, "cs": 11, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "75", "s": 0.988, "e": 1.675, "sm": 987, "em": 1675, "cs": 16, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "days", "s": 1.675, "e": 2.025, "sm": 1675, "em": 2024, "cs": 19, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "after", "s": 2.025, "e": 2.262, "sm": 2025, "em": 2262, "cs": 24, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "the", "s": 2.263, "e": 2.35, "sm": 2262, "em": 2349, "cs": 30, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "last", "s": 2.35, "e": 2.675, "sm": 2350, "em": 2674, "cs": 34, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Astra", "s": 2.675, "e": 3.0, "sm": 2675, "em": 3000, "cs": 39, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "model", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.6, "sm": 3000, "em": 3600, "cs": 45, "ce": 50, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": ",", "s": 3.6, "e": 3.7, "sm": 3600, "em": 3700, "cs": 50, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "and", "s": 3.7, "e": 3.825, "sm": 3700, "em": 3825, "cs": 52, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "OpenAI", "s": 3.825, "e": 4.4, "sm": 3825, "em": 4400, "cs": 56, "ce": 62, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "also", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.75, "sm": 4400, "em": 4749, "cs": 63, "ce": 67, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "launched", "s": 4.75, "e": 5.062, "sm": 4750, "em": 5062, "cs": 68, "ce": 76, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "a", "s": 5.062, "e": 5.138, "sm": 5062, "em": 5137, "cs": 77, "ce": 78, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "smaller", "s": 5.